  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTitle": "<p>Operon D830</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>The Operon D830 has a height adjustment range of 17.3&quot; with a motor-driven longitudinal slide of 16.9&quot;. Intraoperative imaging, precise positioning under C-Arm, and a maximum flexibility are all possible with this versatile surgical table.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The 1,000lb weight capacity at any articulation in normal orientation allows for use in a variety of cases to meet the needs of your OR staff and surgeons. The D830 is compatible with the full line of Operon accessories to transform your surgical table.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 10 2017 12:26:55 GMT-0400",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/pageshortdescription",
